 "html": "\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color has-larger-font-size wp-elements-afd2e9e2bc9eb731f3276e9da2642738\"><strong></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>&#8212;   A Pommery champagne ház pezsgőihez készült pezsgős vödör.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Eredeti vintage francia termék, korának megfelelő állapotban.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Anyaga fém. Elején márkajelzett.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>1 darab 0,75 literes normál palack befogadására alkalmas.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Budapest területén ingyenes a kiszállítás!</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color has-larger-font-size wp-elements-54a12c1ffd6602ade824187533f6dc60\"><strong></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Champagne bucket made for the champagnes of the Pommery champagne house.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Original vintage French product, in good condition for its age.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Its material is metal. Branded on the front.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Suitable for 1 0.75 liter normal bottle.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-larger-font-size\">Champagne Pommery bárfelszerelések és pezsgős ajándéktárgyak a champagneclub.hu kínálatában. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right has-larger-font-size\">Champagne Pommery barware and champagne souvenirs on champagneclub.hu</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/champagneclub.hu/\"></a></figure>\n",
